  "steps": [
    "Sausage. In a large stockpot over medium-high heat, sauté the onion 1 minute, add the sausage, then the spices; cook until almost browned.",
    "Veg. Add carrots and celery; sauté about 5 minutes until softening.",
    "Tomato paste. Stir in and cook 5 minutes until fragrant.",
    "Flour. Sprinkle in and stir 1 minute (it will look dry).",
    "Broth. Gradually pour in the broth, stirring. Boil, then simmer 15 minutes.",
    "Tortellini. Stir in cream, tortellini and spinach; simmer 2–3 minutes until tender.",
    "Finish. Stir in the Parmesan until melted and serve with extra cheese."
